    "Rejected profession ranks and duplicate families consume no materials or shared contribution cooldown.",
    "Both factions can buy the nine standard reagents at native prices. The reagent bot cannot repair.",
    "Insufficient funds refuse repair; paid repair restores real item durability and consumes money.",
